    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Pipe A usually fills a tank in 6 hours. But due to a leak at the bottom of the tank, it takes extra 2 hours to fill the tank. If the tank is full, then how much time will it take to get emptied due to the leak?",
      "questionHtml": "Pipe A usually fills a tank in 6 hours. But due to a leak at the bottom of the tank, it takes extra 2 hours to fill the tank. If the tank is full, then how much time will it take to get emptied due to the leak?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "16 hours",
          "html": "16 hours"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "20 hours",
          "html": "20 hours"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "12 hours",
          "html": "12 hours"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "24 hours",
          "html": "24 hours"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Work rate of the leak = (1 / 6) - (1 / 8)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= (4 - 3) / 24 <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 1 / 24 (tank/hour)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Time to empty the tank = 1 / (1 / 24) = 24 hours</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "Evaluate the value of \\((cosec 56^{\\circ} \\ cos 34^{\\circ} - cos 59^{\\circ} \\ cosec 31^{\\circ})\\) .",
      "questionHtml": "Evaluate the value of <span class=\"math-tex\">\\((cosec 56^{\\circ} \\ cos 34^{\\circ} - cos 59^{\\circ} \\ cosec 31^{\\circ})\\)</span>.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-1",
          "html": "-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>(1 / sin 56°) × cos 34° - cos 59° × (1 / sin 31°)</p>\n\n<p>= (cos 34° / sin 56°) - (cos 59° / sin 31°)</p>\n\n<p>= (cos (90° - 56°) / sin 56°) - (cos 59° / sin (90° - 59°))</p>\n\n<p>= (sin 56° / sin 56°) - (cos 59° / cos 59°)</p>\n\n<p>= 1 - 1</p>\n\n<p><strong>Therefore, the result is 0.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "The following table shows the sales of cars of five manufacturers from 2016 to 2020. (All the figures are in hundreds.) Manufacturer 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 M1 180 190 200 210 220 M2 160 170 180 190 200 M3 190 200 210 220 230 M4 200 210 220 230 240 M5 210 220 230 240 250 What is the difference between the total number of sales of manufacturer M2 and the total number of sales of manufacturer M4 during the years 2016 to 2019?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>The following table shows the sales of cars of five manufacturers from 2016 to 2020. (All the figures are in hundreds.)</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-sheets-baot=\"1\" data-sheets-root=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width:330px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\t<colgroup>\n\t\t<col style=\"text-align: center;\" />\n\t\t<col style=\"text-align: center;\" />\n\t\t<col style=\"text-align: center;\" />\n\t\t<col style=\"text-align: center;\" />\n\t\t<col style=\"text-align: center;\" />\n\t\t<col style=\"text-align: center;\" />\n\t</colgroup>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Manufacturer</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>2016</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>2017</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>2018</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>2019</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>2020</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">M1</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">180</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">190</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">200</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">210</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">220</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">M2</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">160</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">170</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">180</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">190</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">200</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">M3</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">190</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">200</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">210</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">220</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">230</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">M4</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">200</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">210</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">220</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">230</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">240</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">M5</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">210</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">220</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">230</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">240</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">250</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p>What is the difference between the total number of sales of manufacturer M2 and the total number of sales of manufacturer M4 during the years 2016 to 2019?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "12000",
          "html": "12000"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "18000",
          "html": "18000"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "14000",
          "html": "14000"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "16000",
          "html": "16000"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Sales of manufacturer M<sub>2</sub> (in hundreds) from 2016 to 2019 = 160, 170, 180, 190</p>\n\n<p>Sales of manufacturer M<sub>4</sub> (in hundreds) from 2016 to 2019 = 200, 210, 220, 230</p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Total sales = Sum of sales for the years</p>\n\n<p>Difference = Total sales of M<sub>4</sub> - Total sales of M<sub>2</sub></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculations:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Total sales of M<sub>2</sub>:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 160 + 170 + 180 + 190 = 700 (hundreds)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; Total sales of M<sub>2</sub> = 700 &times; 100 = 70,000</p>\n\n<p>Total sales of M<sub>4</sub>:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 200 + 210 + 220 + 230 = 860 (hundreds)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; Total sales of M<sub>4</sub> = 860 &times; 100 = 86,000</p>\n\n<p>Difference:</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 86,000 - 70,000 = 16,000</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The difference is 16,000. Option (4) is correct.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
