amily: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">In which subject did he score the highest marks (in %)?</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
