      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "How many years will it take for ₹8,400 to amount to ₹11,928 at a simple interest rate of 7% per annum?",
      "questionHtml": "How many years will it take for ₹8,400 to amount to ₹11,928 at a simple interest rate of 7% per annum?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "8",
          "html": "8"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>SI = A - P = ₹11,928 - ₹8,400 = ₹3,528</p>\n\n<p>SI = P × R × T / 100</p>\n\n<p>⇒ 3,528 = 8,400 × 7 × T / 100</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">T = (3,528 × 100) / (8,400 × 7) = 352,800 / 58,800 = 6</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "Find the area of a square, one of whose diagonals is 4.8 m long.",
      "questionHtml": "Find the area of a square, one of whose diagonals is 4.8 m long.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "12.5m 2",
          "html": "12.5m<sup>2</sup>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "9.5 m 2",
          "html": "9.5<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">m</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "10.5 m 2",
          "html": "10.5<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">m</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "11.5 m 2",
          "html": "11.5&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">m</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">4.8 = s√2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ s = 4.8 / √2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ s = 4.8 / 1.414 = 3.39 m</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">A = s² = (3.39)²</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ A ≈ 11.49 m²</p>\nA ≈ 11.5 m<sup>2</sup>",
      "images": [],
