      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q11",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "The following bar graph shows the circulation growth of a magazine ABC from July 2022 to December 2022. During October to December there was an even growth rate, the average of which, is (correct up to one decimal place):",
      "questionHtml": "The following bar graph shows the circulation growth of a magazine ABC from July 2022 to December 2022.<br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_Priya_SSC_18_12_24_D6.png\" style=\"width: 512px; height: 276px;\" /><br />\nDuring October to December there was an even growth rate, the average of which, is (correct up to one decimal place):<br />\n&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "3.2%",
          "html": "3.2%"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2.4%",
          "html": "2.4%"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2.9%",
          "html": "2.9%"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3.8%",
          "html": "3.8%"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Final Value = Initial Value × (1 + r)</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">n</span></p>\n\n<p>r = Monthly growth rate (as a decimal)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">n = Number of months (in this case, n = 2 months)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">211,885 = 200,189 × (1 + r)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (1 + r)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 211,885 / 200,189</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (1 + r)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 1.0586</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ r ≈ 0.029, or<strong> 2.9%</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_Priya_SSC_18_12_24_D6.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
