      "questionHtml": "Simplify:<br />\n<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1020 \\div \\left[ \\frac{4}{3} \\text{ of } (26 + 4) - 11 \\frac{2}{3} \\right]\\)</span>",
      "options": [
