      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>1020 ÷ [(4/3) of (26 + 4) - 11 (2/3)]</p>\n\n<p>1020 ÷ [(4/3) of 30 - 35/3]</p>\n\n<p>1020 ÷ (40 - 35/3)</p>\n\n<p>1020 × 3/85 = 36</p>\n",
