      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q14",
      "number": 14,
      "question": "Five different companies, P, Q, R, S and T, manufacture plastic and wooden bats. These bats are labelled as Brand A or Brand B. The given table shows the number of wooden bats as a percentage of the total bats manufactured by each company. It also shows the ratio of plastic bats labelled as Brand A to Brand B. Each company manufactures 1,00,000 bats. Study the table carefully and answer the question that follows. Company Wooden bats Brand A : Brand B P 65% 3 : 7 Q 70% 7 : 8 R 60% 19 : 6 S 70% 7 : 8 T 50% 2 : 3 Taking all companies together, how many plastic bats of Brand B have been manufactured?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Five different companies, P, Q, R, S and T, manufacture plastic and wooden bats. These bats are labelled as Brand A or Brand B. The given table shows the number of wooden bats as a percentage of the total bats manufactured by each company. It also shows the ratio of plastic bats labelled as Brand A to Brand B. Each company manufactures 1,00,000 bats. Study the table carefully and answer the question that follows.</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-sheets-baot=\"1\" data-sheets-root=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width:330px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n\t<colgroup>\n\t\t<col />\n\t\t<col />\n\t\t<col />\n\t</colgroup>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Company</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Wooden bats</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Brand A : Brand B</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">P</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">65%</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3 : 7</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Q</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">70%</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7 : 8</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">60%</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">19 : 6</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">S</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">70%</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7 : 8</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">50%</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2 : 3</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\nTaking all companies together, how many plastic bats of Brand B have been manufactured?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "86,100",
          "html": "86,100"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "96,100",
          "html": "96,100"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "90,500",
          "html": "90,500"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "80,500",
          "html": "80,500"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Total number of Brand B plastic bats:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Total Brand B Plastic Bats = 24,500 + 16,000 + 9,600 + 16,000 + 30,000 = 96,100</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
