      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "66",
          "html": "66"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "60",
          "html": "60"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "62",
          "html": "62"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "64",
          "html": "64"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>Prime numbers between 50 and 76: 53, 59, 61, 67, 71, 73</p>\n\n<p>Sum = 53 + 59 + 61 + 67 + 71 + 73 = 384</p>\n\n<p>Average = 384 / 6 = 64.</p>\n",
