      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q16",
      "number": 16,
      "question": "In a triangle, &Delta;ABC, the &ang;ABC = 90&deg;. If the sin A = 1/2, then cos C is equal to:",
      "questionHtml": "In a triangle,&nbsp;&Delta;ABC, the&nbsp;&ang;ABC = 90&deg;. If the sin A = 1/2, then cos C is equal to:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)",
          "html": "<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)</span></span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "<span style=\"font-size:18px;\">1</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\)</span></span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)</span></span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Sin A = BC/AC </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Cos C = BC/AC </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ Cos C = 1/2</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q17",
      "number": 17,
      "question": "Simplify: \\(\\frac{(4.2)^3 - (1.2)^3}{(4.2)^2 + 5.04 + (1.2)^2} \\)",
      "questionHtml": "Simplify:<br />\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(4.2)^3 - (1.2)^3}{(4.2)^2 + 5.04 + (1.2)^2} \\)</span></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "3",
          "html": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "Given:\n<p>Numerator: (4.2)<sup>3</sup> - (1.2)<sup>3</sup></p>\n\n<p>Using: a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup> = (a - b)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n\n<p>⇒ (4.2)<sup>3</sup> - (1.2)<sup>3</sup> = 3 × ((4.2)<sup>2</sup> + (4.2)(1.2) + (1.2)<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n\n<p>Denominator: (4.2)<sup>2</sup> + 5.04 + (1.2)<sup>2</sup></p>\n\n<p>Simplified result: 3</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q18",
      "number": 18,
      "question": "If 0.4x + 0.16y = 1.7 and 0.3x + 0.12y = 3.4, then which of the following is correct?",
      "questionHtml": "If 0.4x + 0.16y = 1.7 and 0.3x + 0.12y = 3.4, then which of the following is correct?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "The system has finitely many solutions but not unique.",
          "html": "The system has finitely many solutions but not unique."
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "The system has infinitely many solutions.",
          "html": "The system has infinitely many solutions."
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "The system has no solution.",
          "html": "The system has no solution."
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "The system has unique solution.",
          "html": "The system has unique solution."
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>0.4x + 0.16y = 1.7</p>\n\n<p>0.3x + 0.12y = 3.4</p>\n\n<p>(0.4/0.3) = (4/3)</p>\n\n<p>(0.16/0.12) = (4/3)</p>\n\n<p>(1.7/3.4) = (1/2)</p>\n\n<p>Ratios of coefficients of x and y are equal</p>\n\n<p>but ratio of constants is different</p>\n\n<p>System has no solution.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q19",
      "number": 19,
      "question": "S borrowed some amount from R and promised to pay him 8% interest. Then S invested the borrowed amount in a scheme, upon which he earned a profit of 5% after paying R, the principal amount with interest. How much percentage R would have gained, if he would have invested in the scheme directly?",
      "questionHtml": "S borrowed some amount from R and promised to pay him 8% interest. Then S invested the borrowed amount in a scheme, upon which he earned a profit of 5% after paying R, the principal amount with interest. How much percentage R would have gained, if he would have invested in the scheme directly?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "13.4%",
          "html": "13.4%"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "13%",
          "html": "13%"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "14.4%",
          "html": "14.4%"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "14%",
          "html": "14%"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Let the borrowed amount be P</p>\n\n<p>Interest paid to R = 0.08P</p>\n\n<p>Total amount paid to R = 1.08P</p>\n\n<p>Profit earned by S after paying R = 0.05P</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Total earnings of S = 1.13P</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Profit percentage if R invested directly = 13%.</span></p>\n",
