      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f517d4b7ab8-q20",
      "number": 20,
      "question": "Find the value of: [ \\(\\frac{4}{3}\\) tan 2 60&deg; + 3 cos 2 30&deg; - 2 sec 2 30&deg; - \\(\\frac{3}{4}\\) cot 2 60&deg;] &divide; [sin60&deg;cos30&deg;- cos60&deg;sin30&deg;]",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Find the value of:</p>\n\n<p>[<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{4}{3}\\)</span>&nbsp;tan<sup>2</sup>60&deg; + 3 cos<sup>2</sup>30&deg; - 2 sec<sup>2</sup>30&deg; -&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{4}\\)</span>cot<sup>2</sup>60&deg;]&nbsp;&divide; [sin60&deg;cos30&deg;- cos60&deg;sin30&deg;]</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(6 \\frac{2}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(6 \\frac{2}{3}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(3 \\frac{1}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(3 \\frac{1}{2}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(4 \\frac{1}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(4 \\frac{1}{3}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(6 \\frac{3}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(6 \\frac{3}{2}\\)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">[(4)/(3) tan</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> 60º + 3 cos</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> 30º - 2 sec</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> 30º - (3)/(4) cot</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> 60º] ÷ [sin 60º cos 30º - cos 60º sin 30º]</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">tan 60º = √3, cot 60º = 1/√3, cos 30º = √3/2, sec 30º = 2/√3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">tan</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> 60º = 3, sec</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> 30º = 4/3, cot</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> 60º = 1/3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">(4)/(3) × 3 + 3 × (√3/2)</span><sup style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">2</sup><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> - 2 × 4/3 - (3)/(4) × 1/3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">4 + 9/4 - 8/3 - 1/4 = 6 - 8/3 = 10/3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">⇒ </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">sin 60º cos 30º - cos 60º sin 30º = sin(60º - 30º) = sin 30º = 1/2</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Final result: 10/3 ÷ 1/2 = 20/3 = 6 (2)/(3)</span></p>\n",
