      "solution": "<p>Let MP = 100</p>\n\n<p>CP = 75% of 100 = 75</p>\n\n<p>Discount = 15% of 100 = 15</p>\n\n<p>SP = 100 - 15 = 85</p>\n\n<p>Gain % = (85 - 75) / 75 × 100 = 10 / 75 × 100</p>\n\n<p>Gain % = <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">13.33%</span></p>\n",
