      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Relative speed = 11 km/h - 10 km/h = 1 km/h</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Convert to m/min: 1 km/h = 1000/60 = 50/3 m/min</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Distance covered in 9 minutes: (50/3) × 9 = 150 m</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Distance after 9 minutes: 200 m - 150 m = 50 m</span></p>\n",
